{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291240","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1029124001:1":{"text":"维伦先生怎么会在这里……糟糕，大家快逃！","source_cn":"维伦先生怎么会在这里……糟糕，大家快逃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F3F4ED7D64C677","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029124002:1":{"text":"你们想做什么？先说好，吾等追影者可是不会屈服于权威的……暴力也不行！","source_cn":"你们想做什么？先说好，吾等追影者可是不会屈服于权威的…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E7CA9B33AFC1A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029124003:1":{"text":"没、没错！你们要是想来硬的，我华菲斯也绝对不会束手就擒！","source_cn":"没、没错！你们要是想来硬的，我华菲斯也绝对不会束手就擒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6E0406194038892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029124004:1":{"text":"各位小朋友们，放轻松。以你们的年纪，我当然是不会对各位动粗的。不过，我也需要提醒各位——","source_cn":"各位小朋友们，放轻松。以你们的年纪，我当然是不会对各位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80FE09728486EED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029124005:1":{"text":"“追影者”组织“非法运营”。所以，我现在以骑士团的身份宣布解散，如果有反对的成员——","source_cn":"“追影者”组织“非法运营”。所以，我现在以骑士团的身份...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95757FB2E055EE32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029124006:1":{"text":"那我就把你们统统带走，然后通知父母去霍根将军那里领人！","source_cn":"那我就把你们统统带走，然后通知父母去霍根将军那里领人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF421D36D18F718A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029124007:1":{"text":"通、通知父母认真的？完了，我会被爸妈撕成碎片的……","source_cn":"通、通知父母认真的？完了，我会被爸妈撕成碎片的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB06EC4C8A2CD318","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029124008:1":{"text":"我爸妈简直比恶魔还可怕！\n 拜托了，维伦先生！请放过吾——放过我们！","source_cn":"我爸妈简直比恶魔还可怕！\\n 拜托了，维伦先生！请放过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5E521E6A104A3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1029124008":{"text":"我爸妈简直比恶魔还可怕！\n 拜托了，维伦先生！请放过吾——放过我们！","source_cn":"我爸妈简直比恶魔还可怕！\\n 拜托了，维伦先生！请放过吾——放过我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5E521E6A104A3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029124009:1":{"text":"唔……这、这可不是随随便便就能说的事情！这涉及到我们的组织机密——","source_cn":"唔……这、这可不是随随便便就能说的事情！这涉及到我们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD24EDB34482295D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029124010:1":{"text":"得了吧，几个半大孩子搞的过家家组织，能有什么机密？","source_cn":"得了吧，几个半大孩子搞的过家家组织，能有什么机密？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A223CE420762AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029124011:1":{"text":"赶紧回答<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的问题吧，说不定我心情好了就会仁慈一些哦。","source_cn":"赶紧回答<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D618D69EA1AC8F1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"赶紧回答<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的问题吧，说不定我心情好了就会仁慈一些哦。","female":"赶紧回答<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的问题吧，说不定我心情好了就会仁慈一些哦。","variant_male_record_index":"117348","variant_female_record_index":"117349","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029124012:1":{"text":"老大，要不我们还是赶紧招了吧？想想你爸妈！趁现在还来得及……不然我们都会完蛋的！","source_cn":"老大，要不我们还是赶紧招了吧？想想你爸妈！趁现在还来得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45F6D018C92062A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029124013:1":{"text":"好吧……其实我们追影者的最终目的，就是战胜恶魔。","source_cn":"好吧……其实我们追影者的最终目的，就是战胜恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEADB9BE8676B1440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029124014:1":{"text":"哦？这倒还真是……意料之外的答案。","source_cn":"哦？这倒还真是……意料之外的答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4BD7A79DDEF2BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029124015:1":{"text":"哼哼，想不到吧？我们建立这个组织，并不是单纯地崇拜恶魔，而是想要先召唤出恶魔来——","source_cn":"哼哼，想不到吧？我们建立这个组织，并不是单纯地崇拜恶魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68296E4C88D3594","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029124016:1":{"text":"然后狠狠打败他们！","source_cn":"然后狠狠打败他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C482693B7D7017A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029124017:1":{"text":"没错！这样的话，不管是爸爸妈妈，又或者是像维伦先生这样的骑士——","source_cn":"没错！这样的话，不管是爸爸妈妈，又或者是像维伦先生这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39243F5AFBEA193B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029124018:1":{"text":"你们这些大人，一定会发自内心地认可我们的实力！","source_cn":"你们这些大人，一定会发自内心地认可我们的实力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86CEBDE2337707F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029124019:1":{"text":"我们再也不是你们口中的“小孩子”，而是能战胜恶魔的勇士！","source_cn":"我们再也不是你们口中的“小孩子”，而是能战胜恶魔的勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E7E0A2D842F7C8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029124020:1":{"text":"哎呀，真是光靠想象都让人热血沸腾……","source_cn":"哎呀，真是光靠想象都让人热血沸腾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF7448185B8A61D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029124021:1":{"text":"原来如此……你们折腾这么多，就是为了这个目的啊。该怎么说呢……确实是只有小孩子才能做得出来的事情。","source_cn":"原来如此……你们折腾这么多，就是为了这个目的啊。该怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F2DE6ED15A3683A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1029124022:1":{"text":"等一下！什么“先召唤出恶魔，然后再狠狠打败他们”……这不对吧！你们之前可不是这么和我说的啊！","source_cn":"等一下！什么“先召唤出恶魔，然后再狠狠打败他们”……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AE174F0321CF198","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1029124023:1":{"text":"啊？我们……之前是怎么说的来着？","source_cn":"啊？我们……之前是怎么说的来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9425E4658E1087CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1029124024:1":{"text":"你们之前说，恶魔超酷的，追影者的存在就是为了崇拜恶魔！还说大家都有希望成为恶魔的眷属……","source_cn":"你们之前说，恶魔超酷的，追影者的存在就是为了崇拜恶魔！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F976C1FBB8ED33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_